#: rulesmodel.cpp:623
#, kde-format
msgid "Focus stealing prevention"
msgstr "Sprečavanje krađe fokusa"

#: rulesmodel.cpp:625
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"KWin tries to prevent windows that were opened without direct user action "
"from raising themselves and taking focus while you're currently interacting "
"with another window. This property can be used to change the level of focus "
"stealing prevention applied to individual windows and apps.<nl/><nl/>Here's "
"what will happen to a window opened without your direct action at each level "
"of focus stealing prevention:<nl/><list><item><emphasis strong='true'>None:</""emphasis> The window will be raised and focused.</item><item><emphasis "
"strong='true'>Low:</emphasis> Focus stealing prevention will be applied, but "
"in the case of a situation KWin considers ambiguous, the window will be "
"raised and focused.</item><item><emphasis strong='true'>Normal:</emphasis> "
"Focus stealing prevention will be applied, but  in the case of a situation "
"KWin considers ambiguous, the window will <emphasis>not</emphasis> be raised "
"and focused.</item><item><emphasis strong='true'>High:</emphasis> The window "
"will only be raised and focused if it belongs to the same app as the "
"currently-focused window.</item><item><emphasis strong='true'>Extreme:</"
"emphasis> The window will never be raised and focused.</item></list>"
msgstr ""
"KWin pokušava spriječiti prozore otvorene bez izravne korisničke radnje "
"da se sami podignu i preuzmu fokus dok trenutno komunicirate s drugim "
"prozorom. Ovo se svojstvo može koristiti za promjenu razine sprečavanja krađe "
"fokusa koja se primjenjuje na pojedinačne prozore i aplikacije.<nl/><nl/>Evo "
"što će se dogoditi s prozorom otvorenim bez vaše izravne radnje na svakoj "
"razini sprečavanja krađe fokusa:<nl/><list><item><emphasis strong='true'>Bez:</""emphasis> Prozor će biti podignut i fokusiran.</item><item><emphasis "
"strong='true'>Nisko:</emphasis> Primijenit će se sprečavanje krađe fokusa, ali "
"u slučaju situacije koju KWin smatra dvosmislenom, prozor će biti "
"podignut i fokusiran.</item><item><emphasis strong='true'>Normalno:</emphasis> "
"Primijenit će se sprečavanje krađe fokusa, ali u slučaju situacije koju "
"KWin smatra dvosmislenom, prozor <emphasis>neće</emphasis> biti podignut "
"ni fokusiran.</item><item><emphasis strong='true'>Visoko:</emphasis> Prozor "
"će biti podignut i fokusiran samo ako pripada istoj aplikaciji kao i "
"trenutno fokusirani prozor.</item><item><emphasis strong='true'>Ekstremno:</"
"emphasis> Prozor nikada neće biti podignut ni fokusiran.</item></list>"

#: rulesmodel.cpp:650
#, kde-format
msgid "Focus protection"
msgstr "Zaštita fokusa"

#: rulesmodel.cpp:652
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"This property controls the focus protection level of the currently active "
"window. It is used to override the focus stealing prevention applied to new "
"windows that are opened without your direct action.<nl/><nl/>Here's what "
"happens to new windows that are opened without your direct action at each "
"level of focus protection while the window with this property applied to it "
"has focus:<nl/><list><item><emphasis strong='true'>None</emphasis>: Newly-"
"opened windows always raise themselves and take focus.</item><item><emphasis "
"strong='true'>Low:</emphasis> Focus stealing prevention will be applied to "
"the newly-opened window, but in the case of a situation KWin considers "
"ambiguous, the window will be raised and focused.</item><item><emphasis "
"strong='true'>Normal:</emphasis> Focus stealing prevention will be applied "
"to the newly-opened window, but in the case of a situation KWin considers "
"ambiguous, the window will <emphasis>not</emphasis> be raised and focused.</"
"item><item><emphasis strong='true'>High:</emphasis> Newly-opened windows "
"will only raise themselves and take focus if they belongs to the same app as "
"the currently-focused window.</item><item><emphasis strong='true'>Extreme:</"
"emphasis> Newly-opened windows never raise themselves and take focus.</"
"item></list>"
msgstr ""
"Ovo svojstvo upravlja razinom zaštite fokusa trenutno aktivnog prozora. Koristi se "
"za nadilaženje sprečavanja krađe fokusa primijenjenog na nove prozore koji se "
"otvaraju bez vaše izravne radnje.<nl/><nl/>Evo što se događa s novim prozorima "
"otvorenim bez vaše izravne radnje na svakoj razini zaštite fokusa dok prozor "
"s ovim primijenjenim svojstvom ima fokus:<nl/><list><item><emphasis strong='true'>Bez</emphasis>: "
"Novotvoreni prozori uvijek se sami podižu i preuzimaju fokus.</item><item><emphasis "
"strong='true'>Nisko:</emphasis> Sprečavanje krađe fokusa primijenit će se na "
"novotvoreni prozor, ali u slučaju situacije koju KWin smatra dvosmislenom, prozor "
"će biti podignut i fokusiran.</item><item><emphasis strong='true'>Normalno:</emphasis> "
"Sprečavanje krađe fokusa primijenit će se na novotvoreni prozor, ali u slučaju "
"situacije koju KWin smatra dvosmislenom, prozor <emphasis>neće</emphasis> biti "
"podignut ni fokusiran.</item><item><emphasis strong='true'>Visoko:</emphasis> "
"Novotvoreni prozori podignut će se i preuzeti fokus samo ako pripadaju istoj "
"aplikaciji kao i trenutno fokusirani prozor.</item><item><emphasis strong='true'>Ekstremno:</"
"emphasis> Novotvoreni prozori se nikada ne podižu sami i ne preuzimaju fokus.</"
"item></list>"

#: rulesmodel.cpp:678
#, kde-format
msgid "Accept focus"
msgstr "Prihvati fokus"

#: rulesmodel.cpp:680
#, kde-format
msgid "Controls whether or not the window becomes focused when clicked."
msgstr "Upravlja time postaje li prozor fokusiran kada se klikne."

#: rulesmodel.cpp:684
#, kde-format
msgid "Ignore global shortcuts"
msgstr "Zanemari globalne prečace"

#: rulesmodel.cpp:686
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Use this property to prevent global keyboard shortcuts from working while "
"the window is focused. This can be useful for apps like emulators or virtual "
"machines that handle some of the same shortcuts themselves.<nl/><nl/>Note "
"that you won't be able to <shortcut>Alt+Tab</shortcut> out of the window or "
"use any other global shortcuts such as <shortcut>Alt+Space</shortcut> to "
"activate KRunner."
msgstr ""
"Koristite ovo svojstvo kako biste spriječili rad globalnih prečaca tipkovnice "
"dok je prozor fokusiran. Ovo može biti korisno za aplikacije poput emulatora ili "
"virtualnih strojeva koji sami upravljaju nekim od istih prečaca.<nl/><nl/>Imajte "
"na umu da nećete moći izaći iz prozora pomoću <shortcut>Alt+Tab</shortcut> niti "
"koristiti bilo koje druge globalne prečace poput <shortcut>Alt+Space</shortcut> "
"za aktiviranje KRunnera."

